
---

### 2. **.gitignore**

```gitignore
# Backup files
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.bak
backups/
*.log

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Sensitive
*.env
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.jks
*secret*
*password*
*.cloudflared/*.json
!configs/cloudflared-config.yml

# Data
ollama_data/
pgdata/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Temporary
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
